1	//! LLM-facing tools for managing routines.
2	//!
3	//! Seven tools let the agent manage routines conversationally:
4	//! - `routine_create` - Create a new routine
5	//! - `routine_list` - List all routines with status
6	//! - `routine_update` - Modify or toggle a routine
7	//! - `routine_delete` - Remove a routine
8	//! - `routine_fire` - Manually trigger a routine
9	//! - `routine_history` - View past runs
10	//! - `event_emit` - Emit a structured system event to `system_event`-triggered routines
11	
